flowchart TD
  owner["Start here: configured<br/>source boundaries"]:::start
  acquire["Ravel CLI checks each origin<br/>and captures before the worker"]
  snapshot["Read-only source trees<br/>and directory descriptor"]
  run["Harness run during evaluation:<br/>same paths and variable"]
  parent["Managed harness: same paths<br/>and its own result context"]
  sandbox["Harness sandbox: selected by<br/>the configuration script"]
  delegate["Ordinary delegate: same directories<br/>may inherit the parent result context"]
  adapter["Controlled adapter: forward paths and reads<br/>and scrub the parent result context"]
  protected["Configuration directory, settings,<br/>skill cache and result channels"]
  owner -->|1. canonical boundaries| acquire
  acquire -->|2. publish the complete set| snapshot
  snapshot -->|3a. absolute paths| run
  snapshot -->|3b. absolute paths| parent
  sandbox -.->|only boundary of reads and writes| run
  sandbox -.->|only boundary of reads and writes| parent
  parent -->|4. forward paths, forbid the parent ending| delegate
  parent -->|alternative: measure isolation| adapter
  protected -.->|overlap refuses, never captured| acquire
  classDef start fill:#173451,color:#fff,stroke:#102a43,font-weight:bold
